Package: stacbuildr
Title: Create SpatioTemporal Asset Catalogs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Steven", "Pawley", , "dr.stevenpawley@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds geospatial metadata catalogs that conform to the
    SpatioTemporal Asset Catalog ('STAC') specification version 1.1.0, an open
    standard for describing geospatial assets so that they can be indexed,
    searched and shared <https://stacspec.org/>. Catalogs, Collections and
    Items are represented as 'S7' classes and serialised to 'STAC' JSON, with
    support for the electro-optical, raster, projection, classification, point
    cloud, datacube, table, vector, render and scientific citation extensions.
    Items can be created directly from 'terra' rasters, 'sf' vector data and
    'lidR' point clouds, and catalogs can be validated against the published
    'STAC' JSON schemas.
